        <<jump Scene_FreeRoam>>
    -> 挑水 <<if get_item("water") <= 1>>
        <<jump Scene_FetchWater>>
    -> 離開
        <<go_to_location 0>>
        <<jump Scene_FreeRoam>>
<<elseif is_kitchen_done_for_now() and not is_time_after(17, 0)>>
    -> 煮飯（今天煮過早飯了，晚上再來）
        阿蘭: （今天早上的飯已經煮過了，晚上再來煮晚飯吧。）
        <<go_to_location 0>>
        <<jump Scene_FreeRoam>>
    -> 煮豬菜 <<if not is_pig_food_done_for_now() and not has_flag("pig_food_leaf_consumed") and get_item("sweetPotatoLeaves") > 0 and get_item("firewood") > 0>>
        <<jump Scene_CookPigFood>>
